     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Range of Cell Phone Subscriptions Per Hundred People</th>\n<th>Frequency</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>0.0 – 24.9</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25.0 – 49.9</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50.0 – 74.9</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>75.0 – 99.9</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100.0 – 124.9</td>\n<td>7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>125.0 – 149.9</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>150.0 – 174.9</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>175.0 – 199.9</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr></tbody>\n</table>\n<p>(Note: Answers may vary based on choices made about bins.)</p>"
